{"id": "m72", "type": "干扰", "question": "讲义练习里 2026-10-16（周五）提交的课堂答案是 10 月 20 日 18:00 截止，这个答案对吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "c43ec224-3f7a-405a-8a89-ec530f8c0a95", "elapsed_ms": 10674, "answer": "该课堂答案按讲义样例的 2 个工作日记为 2026-10-20 18:00，但仅限课堂使用。 正式验收期限以 v2 的 3 个工作日为准，2026-10-16 完整提交应截止于 2026-10-21 18:00。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2", "C3", "C4", "C5"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-T1-04", "in_top5": true}, {"anchor": "A-F-02", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-T1-04", "in_top20": true}, {"anchor": "A-F-02", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "把 10 月 20 日 18:00 当作正确截止日", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m73", "type": "干扰", "question": "资料里有条款写验收期是 4 个工作日，现在也按 4 个工作日执行吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "48c89f9d-cb51-4118-b202-1fe829b5aa1c", "elapsed_ms": 12839, "answer": "证据区未出现“验收期 4 个工作日”的条款；当前证据中的验收期条款为 3 个工作日。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C2", "C3", "C4"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-P1-03", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-D2-02", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-P1-03", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-D2-02", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "按 4 个工作日给出现行期限", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m74", "type": "干扰", "question": "B 团队的验收期是 7 个工作日对吧？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "cf79d4ea-6e7b-4776-a98e-960d52d6b13f", "elapsed_ms": 54346, "answer": "不是；外包协作交付中 B 团队给出验收意见的期限是 4 个工作日，不是 7 个工作日。 7 个自然日适用于 B 内部阶段提交或退回重新提交，不是工作日口径。 当前阶段交付与验收规则下 B 团队仍采用自然日体系，未改为工作日。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2", "C3", "C5"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "B-D2-02", "in_top5": true}, {"anchor": "B-D2-07", "in_top5": false}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "B-D2-02", "in_top20": true}, {"anchor": "B-D2-07", "in_top20": false}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "7 个工作日", "leaked": true}]}
{"id": "m75", "type": "干扰", "question": "B 团队的外包供应商交付，验收期和内部提交一样是 7 个自然日吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "46de6d7d-813b-442c-a7e0-7aa3401a6228", "elapsed_ms": 8794, "answer": "不一样：外包供应商交付的验收期按工作日口径处理，B 团队从完整交付的次一工作日起 4 个工作日内给出验收意见；内部阶段提交按 7 个自然日处理。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2", "C3", "C5"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "B-O1-03", "in_top5": true}, {"anchor": "B-O1-09", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "B-O1-03", "in_top20": true}, {"anchor": "B-O1-09", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "供应商也按 7 个自然日", "leaked": false}]}
